    "name": "Effect: Full Release",
    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your spirit weapon's damage die increases by one step, your Release Technique costs no Reiatsu Points but works only once per round, and you emit a <strong>15-foot emanation</strong> of crushing spiritual pressure &mdash; an enemy that ends its turn in it must succeed at a Will save against your Reiatsu DC or become <strong>frightened 1</strong>, or <strong>frightened 2</strong> on a critical failure. A creature that succeeds is temporarily immune for 10 minutes.</p><p>When this ends you are <strong>fatigued</strong> until you rest for 10 minutes.</p>"
